![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401214242.jpg) Meeting one of the local Djembe makers. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401223841.jpg) Solo Keita deciding that the drum was big enough for him to hop inside! ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401224227.jpg) Me thinking that is a great idea! ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401230424.jpg) City, Conakry. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401230455.jpg) View from the car most of the time. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180401234255.jpg) Eating snapper at Solo's favourite restaurant. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180403000835.jpg) Meeting new friends that I will never forget. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180403010108.jpg) Balafon class practice under the trees inbetween dance classes. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180403012615.jpg) Catching moments with new friends. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180403040651.jpg) The team! ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180407214051.jpg) Catching a boat out to the island for the day. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180406050259.jpg) Bebe, touched my heart. We sang Incy Wincy Spider and this girl can dance! ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180408005952.jpg) Island Fun! ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180408030906.jpg) Baobab trees bigger than you can imagine. ![](/media/2018/04/IMG20180408031352.jpg) Manet riding the elephant.
